            <pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 22:23:50 GMT</pubDate>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[
<div>
    
    
    
    <p>This special issue in the Journal of Environmental Management focuses on water pollution control and ecosystem restoration through an integrated One Water approach. The call seeks research that addresses environmental management strategies for tackling water pollution while simultaneously restoring degraded ecosystems.</p>
    
    <p>
        Appel publié par Journal of Environmental Management.
        
        <a href="https://www.sciencedirect.com/special-issue/337371/environmental-management-perspectives-on-water-pollution-control-and-ecosystem-restoration-within-the-one-water-framework">Voir l'appel sur le site de l'éditeur</a>.
        
        <a href="https://kerostig.org/call/elsevier-environmental-management-perspectives-on-water-pollution-control-and-ecosystem-restoration-within-the-one-water-framework/">Fiche de l'appel sur kerostig</a>.
    </p>
    
    
    <h2>Timeline</h2>
